{"id":"2afb05d81a538d8a","group":"91","path":"91/91-lem-jump-monotonicity.md","title":"强Kleene跳跃在信息序下单调","display":"lem-jump-monotonicity — 强Kleene跳跃在信息序下单调","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-lem-jump-monotonicity","aliases":["91-lem-jump-monotonicity","91-lem-kripke-monotonicity"],"display":"lem-jump-monotonicity — 强Kleene跳跃在信息序下单调","depends_on":["[[91-df-jump-operator]]","[[91-df-strong-kleene]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-lem-jump-monotonicity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-lem-jump-monotonicity</span><span>91-lem-kripke-monotonicity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-jump-monotonicity — 强Kleene跳跃在信息序下单调"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" href=\"?note=ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" title=\"91-df-jump-operator\">91-df-jump-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fcfe6f023ac58abf\" href=\"?note=fcfe6f023ac58abf\" title=\"91-df-strong-kleene\">91-df-strong-kleene</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"lem-jump-monotonicity-—-强-Kleene-跳跃在信息序下单调\">lem-jump-monotonicity — 强 Kleene 跳跃在信息序下单调</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Info}_{c}\">\\(\\operatorname{Info}_{c}\\)</span> (一致的句子编码信息集类)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Info}_{c}\">\\(X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Info}_{c}\\)</span> (相容信息状态)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\sqsubseteq_iY\\coloneqq X\\subseteq Y\">\\(X\\sqsubseteq_iY\\coloneqq X\\subseteq Y\\)</span> (信息增长序)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J:\\operatorname{Info}_{c}\\to\\operatorname{Info}_{c}\">\\(J:\\operatorname{Info}_{c}\\to\\operatorname{Info}_{c}\\)</span>\n(由强 Kleene 递归求值定义的真理跳跃,\nsee <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" href=\"?note=ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" title=\"91-df-jump-operator\">91-df-jump-operator</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}jump\\text{-}monotonicity}\\vdash\nX\\sqsubseteq_iY\n\\to\nJ(X)\\sqsubseteq_iJ(Y).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}jump\\text{-}monotonicity}\\vdash\nX\\sqsubseteq_iY\n\\to\nJ(X)\\sqsubseteq_iJ(Y).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>证明对公式结构归纳。把未定信息细化为真或假不会撤销已经确定的\n强 Kleene 真值；真理原子、否定、联结词和量词递归都保持信息序。</p>\n<p>这里的序是信息增长序，不是经典真假顺序。单调性足以应用固定点定理，\n但不蕴含跳跃保持任意有向并；连续性是另一个、更强的条件。弱 Kleene\n是否适用同一结论也必须相对于明确的信息域和跳跃定义判断，不能作为\n无条件反例。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"lem-jump-monotonicity-—-强-Kleene-跳跃在信息序下单调","text":"lem-jump-monotonicity — 强 Kleene 跳跃在信息序下单调","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-jump-operator","status":"resolved","id":"ae9eced0b12cbd2a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-jump-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-strong-kleene","status":"resolved","id":"fcfe6f023ac58abf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-strong-kleene]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-jump-operator","status":"resolved","id":"ae9eced0b12cbd2a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$J:\\operatorname{Info}_{c}\\to\\operatorname{Info}_{c}$\n(由强 Kleene 递归求值定义的真理跳跃,\nsee [[91-df-jump-operator]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Info}_{c}","display":false},{"tex":"X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Info}_{c}","display":false},{"tex":"X\\sqsubseteq_iY\\coloneqq X\\subseteq Y","display":false},{"tex":"J:\\operatorname{Info}_{c}\\to\\operatorname{Info}_{c}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}jump\\text{-}monotonicity}\\vdash\nX\\sqsubseteq_iY\n\\to\nJ(X)\\sqsubseteq_iJ(Y).","display":true}],"bytes":1347,"backlinks":[{"id":"9360972f9b2f8524","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b78700f82584ead6","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"3986b1fdb85a0caf","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["ae9eced0b12cbd2a","fcfe6f023ac58abf"]}